- New `sttDemo` widget (`src/widgets/SttDemo/`): Zod schema with `maxDurationSeconds` (default 10, clamped to [1, 60]), runtime component that records via `MediaRecorder` with a click-to-toggle button + animated red-dot + `mm:ss` timer + auto-stop at the configured cap, and an editor for the duration cap.
